OL,3,GNEWSAWill mayor's 'Visit East Midlands'
OL,4,Ascheme deliver?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn her first interview as mayor of the
OL,7,FEast Midlands in May 2024, Labour's
OL,8,FClaire Ward was asked for a "yardstick"
OL,9,Fagainst which voters should judge her
OL,10,Fat the next mayoral election.
OL,12,FHer first response was that the region
OL,13,Falways seemed to "miss out" on public
OL,14,Ffunding and she would put it "on the
OL,15,Fmap".
OL,17,FThere have been wins and losses on that
OL,18,Ffront.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
