OL,3,GNEWSAWill mayor's 'Visit East Midlands'
OL,4,Ascheme deliver?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSecondly, Ward promised to create a new
OL,7,Fbody, Visit East Midlands, to harness
OL,8,FDerbyshire and Nottinghamshire's
OL,9,Fpotential as tourism destinations.
